OL,3,GNEWSABoro legends return for 150th
OL,4,Aanniversary match
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlmost 100 former Middlesbrough players
OL,7,Fand managers returned to Teesside for a
OL,8,Flegacy game celebrating 150 years of
OL,9,Fthe club.
OL,11,FA sold-out crowd of more than 30,000
OL,12,Ffilled the Riverside Stadium to watch
OL,13,Fclub legends including Juninho,
OL,14,FFabrizio Ravanelli, Yakubu and Aitor
OL,15,FKaranka.
OL,17,FThe game saw two squads of former Boro
OL,18,Fplayers go head-to-head, with others
OL,19,Ffeaturing in a non-playing capacity
OL,20,Fincluding a lap of honour and a
OL,21,Fpresentation of legacy numbers.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
